<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header', { page: page }) %>

<section class="section alt" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Get in touch</div>
    <h2>Tell us about the project.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Send site dimensions, drawings, or just a rough idea on WhatsApp or the form below — we'll come back with a real quote, not a placeholder.</p>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="info-row"><div class="info-label">Address</div><div class="info-value">Islamabad, Pakistan</div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><div class="info-label">Phone</div><div class="info-value"><a href="tel:03323646827">0332-3646827</a></div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><div class="info-label">Phone</div><div class="info-value"><a href="tel:03014886860">0301-4886860</a></div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><div class="info-label">WhatsApp</div><div class="info-value"><a href="https://wa.me/923014886860">Chat with us directly</a></div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><div class="info-label">Email</div><div class="info-value"><a href="mailto:Ramzanjadraan112@gmail.com">Ramzanjadraan112@gmail.com</a></div></div>
        <div class="info-row"><div class="info-label">Hours</div><div class="info-value">Mon–Sat, 9:00am – 6:00pm</div></div>
        <div class="social-row">
          <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M13.5 21v-8h2.7l.4-3.1h-3.1V8c0-.9.25-1.5 1.55-1.5H16.7V3.7C16.4 3.65 15.4 3.55 14.25 3.55c-2.4 0-4.05 1.45-4.05 4.15V9.9H7.5V13h2.7v8h3.3z"/></svg></a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.94 8.5H3.56V20.5h3.38V8.5zM5.25 3.5a1.96 1.96 0 100 3.92 1.96 1.96 0 000-3.92zM20.5 20.5h-3.37v-6.19c0-1.48-.03-3.38-2.06-3.38-2.07 0-2.39 1.62-2.39 3.28v6.29H9.31V8.5h3.24v1.64h.05c.45-.86 1.56-1.77 3.2-1.77 3.43 0 4.06 2.26 4.06 5.2v6.93z"/></svg></a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/923323646827" aria-label="WhatsApp"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91c0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21h.01c5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91C21.96 6.45 17.5 2 12.04 2z"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="map-frame">Map — Islamabad, Pakistan</div>
      </div>
      <form method="POST" action="/contact">
        <div class="field-row">
          <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
        </div>
        <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone number">
        <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about the project — dimensions, timeline, budget"></textarea>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary submit-btn">
          <% if (typeof sent !== 'undefined' && sent) { %>Sent — we'll be in touch<% } else { %>Send Message<% } %>
        </button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ SERVICE AREAS ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Where we work</div>
    <h2>Nationwide delivery, local install crews.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Based in Islamabad, with regular projects across the twin cities and beyond. Outside these areas, we still deliver — installation is scoped case by case.</p>
    <div class="cities-row" style="margin-top:26px;">
      <span class="city-chip" style="border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);">Islamabad</span>
      <span class="city-chip" style="border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);">Rawalpindi</span>
      <span class="city-chip" style="border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);">DHA &amp; Bahria Town</span>
      <span class="city-chip" style="border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);">Lahore</span>
      <span class="city-chip" style="border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);">Karachi (on request)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="section alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Before you write in</div>
    <h2>Quick answers.</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>What's the fastest way to get a quote?</summary><p>WhatsApp with your dimensions or a rough sketch — it's usually the quickest way to get a first estimate back.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you charge for site visits?</summary><p>Initial consultations within Islamabad and Rawalpindi are free; travel further afield is discussed upfront.</p></details>
      <details class="faq-item"><summary>Can I visit the workshop?</summary><p>Yes, workshop visits can be arranged by appointment — just mention it when you reach out.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<%- include('partials/fab') %>

<script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
